### send test notification

POST {{port6011}}/notify/send-test HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "This is a test notification from postman",
  "metaData": {
    "action": "friend_request",
    "actionId": "12345abcde",
    "extra": {
      "deeplink": "myapp://friends/requests",
      "priority": "high",
      "sound": "ping"
    },
    "messagePreview": "John Doe sent you a friend request"
  },
  "notificationChannel": "BOTH",
  "receiverId": "694a39873340ac9b4e138239",
  "senderId": "696e0f7ac1538597d9cb43f4",
  "title": "10 Send test notification",
  "type": "SCHEDULE"
}


### my notifications

# / isRead=> true, false, all

GET {{port6011}}/notify/my?page=1&limit=20&isRead=all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{ashRaisa}}


### get single notification and marks as read

GET {{port6011}}/notify/single/6978616ac37761286140fef8 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{ashRaisa}}


### get notification unread count

GET {{port8012}}/notify/unread-count HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{ashsrasu}}


### mark all as read or unread

PATCH {{port6011}}/notify/mark-all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{ashsrasu}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isRead": false
}
